  "title": "Microsoft & enterprise integration",
  "description": "## Overview\n\nThis original synthetic example explores a document and business-record integration. It is not deployed and is not a direct Microsoft Learn adaptation. Named badges are not corporate logos; SimpleBadge is original custom artwork.\n\n## Flow\n\nBusiness users work with SharePoint and Dynamics 365. Logic Apps and Service Bus illustrate orchestration and queued work, while custom processing connects with SAP and Oracle. Key Vault and Azure Monitor represent supporting platform responsibilities, not configured integrations.\n\n## Decisions\n\nDefine record ownership, connector permissions, retries, duplicate handling, and reconciliation before connecting enterprise systems. Boundaries express intended team responsibility and do not establish trust, access, or transactional guarantees.\n\n## Start Editing\n\nRename the workflow and integration owners. Replace the custom badge with your approved artifact, remove unused systems, and describe the business identifiers exchanged on each path. Record recovery and auditing requirements separately from the happy-path flow.\n\n## Reference\n\nOriginal bundled Enterprise illustration, not copied from a specific Learn architecture. Consult your actual systems' product and connector documentation before implementing the illustrated interactions.",
